   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## WEB1 Klein: hero and key art (text to image)\nFull-quality FLUX 3 Klein for the images a page is built around: hero banners, section key art, feature illustrations. Write a **full scene caption**: subject, setting, light, palette, lens/camera, and where the **empty space for the headline** goes.\n\n- **Aspect (Resolution node):** 16:9 hero (default), 21:9 ultrawide banner, 3:2 section/feature image. 2.0 MP default (~1920 px wide). 2x: WEB6b for shipped assets, WEB6 for boards.\n- **Model:** full model, 30 steps, CFG 3.5 (~40 s). 50 steps for finals. Drafts: switch to `flux3_image_klein_sd_int8_convrot`, steps 12, **CFG 1** (~12 s).\n- **Negative** only works when CFG > 1 (full model). It already bans text and logos.\n- **Photographic preset:** *Editorial photograph, shot on a 35 mm lens at f/2.8, soft natural window light, shallow depth of field, true-to-life colour, subtle film grain.*\n- **Illustrative preset:** *Flat vector-style editorial illustration, clean geometric shapes, limited palette of [3-4 colours], soft paper grain, no outlines, generous empty background.*\n- Always end with *no text, no letters, no logos*. Real copy is set in HTML."
   ]
  },
