   "widgets_values": [
    "Wide editorial photograph. A calm, sunlit studio workspace: a pale oak desk on the right third of the frame with a ceramic mug, a small potted olive tree and an open notebook, morning light streaming through a tall window, long soft shadows across a warm off-white plaster wall. The left half of the frame is clean, softly lit empty wall with plenty of negative space for a headline. Muted palette of cream, sand, sage green and soft charcoal. Shot on a 35 mm lens at f/2.8, shallow depth of field, true-to-life colour, subtle film grain. No text, no letters, no logos."
